abstract: >-
  Temporal AI Presence is sustained bounded AI participation across time. This
  standalone profile defines the temporal-presence category, preserves the
  boundary between TAP and c-class systems, specifies ten mandatory TAP tests,
  and publishes a conservative public-safe evidence projection. TAP-T03 remains
  partial at the deployment boundary. The work claims neither TAP-C nor a full
  M4 pass and assigns no standalone DOI in this deposit candidate.
